'''Narvalis Point''' is an [[Alliance]]-aligned encampment located in northeast [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. It is the base camp of a Sentinels expedition led by [[Sentinel Commander Silverstreak]] sent by General [[Shandris Feathermoon]] to investigate reports of strange events along Moonwhisper's forgotten shores.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|54|Endless Vigil}}</ref>

